# Geopipeline

The goal is to identify the geographical locations mentioned in a text, not simply assign the town an article is about.

cell                  items     excluded        spans     no_place     flag_fig  flag_unsure    flag_hist
de/news                  40            0           67           16            6            0            0
de/wikipedia             40            0           36           23            8            2            0
en/news                  40            0           63           18            0            1            0
en/wikipedia             40            0           56           21            7            1            3

