## Results

== strict (strenger Vergleich)
group             docs   gold      P      R     F1
all                160    222   0.54   0.93   0.69
de/news             40     67   0.58   0.93   0.71
de/wikipedia        40     36   0.36   0.92   0.52
en/news             40     63   0.59   0.87   0.70
en/wikipedia        40     56   0.64   1.00   0.78

